## Summary
Gamescom Dev's speaker survey found that 83% of respondents anticipate AI will affect team structure or productivity. The survey highlights the expected impact of AI on the gaming industry's workforce. Gamescom Dev's annual survey provides insight into the gaming industry's expectations around AI adoption.

## Key Points
- 83% of Gamescom Dev speaker survey respondents expect AI to impact team structure
- AI anticipated to affect productivity in the gaming industry
- Survey reflects industry expectations around AI adoption


